# PhotoCraft, the image editor, and its command line, compiled by Cargo from the pinned sources,
# offline. The app draws on the page through Dolly's platforms in winit (display@0, input@0) and
# wgpu (gpu@0), and its dialogs are the zenity command. The command line converts and inspects
# images and PSD files, runs commands and batches, renders on gpu@0 where the browser grants
# WebGPU, and serves its commands to agents over MCP. zenity, built by a run of its own so that
# egui keeps PhotoCraft's features, is the dialogs, on the same platforms.
